# KSI-AFR-UCM: Azure Disk Encryption Set - Customer-Managed Key Encryption
# Validates DES uses customer-managed keys with auto-rotation

META
    esp_id `ksi-afr-ucm-az-disk-encryption-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `azure`
    criticality `critical`

    title `KSI-AFR-UCM: Azure DES - customer-managed key with auto-rotation`
    description `Validates that the disk encryption set uses customer-managed keys for encryption at rest with automatic key rotation enabled, ensuring data sovereignty and cryptographic agility`
    author `security-team`
    tags `azure,des,disk-encryption,cmk,key-rotation,encryption-at-rest`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-AFR-UCM,NIST:SC-28(1),NIST:SC-12`
    control_objective `KSI-AFR-UCM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `cloud-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `7`
    recommendation `Create disk encryption set with customer-managed key and enable auto-rotation via the key vault key rotation policy`

    impl_KSI_AFR_UCM `Use of cryptographic modules for data at rest is validated by confirming the disk encryption set is provisioned (provisioning_state=Succeeded) with EncryptionAtRestWithCustomerKey encryption type, ensuring managed disks are encrypted using organization-controlled keys stored in Azure Key Vault rather than platform-managed keys. Automatic key rotation (auto_key_rotation_enabled=true) ensures cryptographic keys are regularly rotated without manual intervention, maintaining cryptographic agility and reducing the window of exposure if a key is compromised. The DES uses a system-assigned managed identity for Key Vault access, following least-privilege principles.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT des_demo
        name `des-example-prod`
        resource_group `rg-example-eastus`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE st_cmk_encrypted
        found boolean = true
        provisioning_state string = `Succeeded`
        encryption_type string = `EncryptionAtRestWithCustomerKey`
        auto_key_rotation_enabled boolean = true
        identity_type string = `SystemAssigned`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN az_disk_encryption_set
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF st_cmk_encrypted
            OBJECT_REF des_demo
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
